OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ADuran Duran guitarist Andy Taylor dies 
OL,4,Aaged 65                                
OL,6,FHis wife, Tracey, said the musician    
OL,7,F"was the rock of our family", adding:  
OL,8,F"We will miss him every single day".   
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
